Bundling
--------
Only shared/melspectrogram.onnx, shared/embedding_model.onnx and
models/ok_nabu/ok_nabu.onnx ship inside the APK. Every other classifier is
fetched on demand so its license can be shown before download.

openWakeWord has no stop model. Ava's stop word is a microWakeWord model and
carries its own notice under app/src/main/assets/stopWords/.
